And I know this because
Tab For a Cause's finances

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:21.440
are 100% transparent.

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.210
You can see for yourself
how much they've raised

00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:24.360
and where it has gone.

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:25.470
All you have to do is click on the link

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:27.600
that's on screen right
now or in the description

00:22:27.600 --> 00:22:29.220
to install this browser extension.

00:22:29.220 --> 00:22:30.053
That's it.

00:22:30.053 --> 00:22:31.260
Every page that you then open

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:33.460
