00:22:33.460 --> 00:22:35.080
So, just click on the
link that's on screen.

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:37.020
It's the easiest way to donate to charity.

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:38.000
And you can even just sit there

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.540
